# Pump encoding, gUFO (pins: nemo-ufes/gufo @ f412254).
#
# R1: componentOf, typed. The artifact ships isComponentOf beneath
# isObjectProperPartOf, with domain gufo:Object and range
# gufo:FunctionalComplex; the theory's necessity overlay (essential
# parthood) is not carried by the artifact, whose own documentation for
# isComponentOf notes only non-transitivity and the qualified-parthood
# pattern.
#
# Declarations repeat the pinned artifact's typing so the file renders
# correctly on its own (in Protege, undeclared properties display as
# annotations); semantics come only from gufo.ttl at the pin.
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix gufo: <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#> .
@prefix p:    <https://example.org/mt-pump#> .

gufo:Kind              a owl:Class .
gufo:FunctionalComplex a owl:Class .
gufo:isComponentOf     a owl:ObjectProperty .

p:Pump a owl:Class, gufo:Kind .
p:Impeller a owl:Class, gufo:Kind .
p:pump1 a gufo:FunctionalComplex, p:Pump .
p:impeller1 a gufo:FunctionalComplex, p:Impeller ;
    gufo:isComponentOf p:pump1 .

# R2: the impeller-housing joint is inexpressible. gUFO carries no
# connection predicate; topology enters the corpus only as a classifier
# (maximal self-connectedness in prose).
